{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11101230","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11101230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110123001:0":{"text":"먹을 것을 찾고 계세요? 먹을 게 얼마 없긴 하지만... 걱정하지 마세요!","source_cn":"你们是在找食物吗？食物不太多了……不过别担心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB943F2125502B0ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110123002:0":{"text":"아르사가 오늘 맛있는 걸 가지고 돌아왔대요! 멧돼지인 것 같아요!","source_cn":"听说阿尔萨今天带了好吃的回来！似乎是野猪呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA461D84112313A52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110123003:0":{"text":"잠깐 기다려주세요. 소렌이 요리하러 갔거든요.","source_cn":"客人可以稍等会，索恩已经去料理了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A96F26E3034465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110123003":{"text":"잠깐 기다려주세요. 소렌이 요리하러 갔거든요.","source_cn":"客人可以稍等会，索恩已经去料理了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A96F26E3034465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110123004:0":{"text":"오늘은 충분할 거예요. 맛있는 부분은 손님들께 나눠 드리고, 다른 부위는 저희끼리 나눠 먹으면 돼요.","source_cn":"今天肯定是够的，肉排给客人之后，其他的部位我们就能分着吃了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14DF5B6519104CA3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"오늘은 충분할 거예요. 맛있는 부분은 손님들께 나눠 드리고, 다른 부위는 저희끼리 나눠 먹으면 돼요.","female":